# Flutter UI Conventions

## 1. File Naming

```dart
// ✅ ĐÚNG - lowercase_with_underscores
// features/meal_plan/views/meal_plan_screen.dart
// features/meal_plan/widgets/meal_item_tile.dart
// features/meal_plan/providers/meal_plan_provider.dart

// ❌ SAI
// MealPlanScreen.dart
// mealPlanScreen.dart
```

---

## 2. Widget Naming

```dart
// ✅ StatelessWidget
class MealItemTile extends StatelessWidget { ... }
class CalorieProgressRing extends StatelessWidget { ... }
class EmptyStateWidget extends StatelessWidget { ... }

// ✅ StatefulWidget  
class HomeScreen extends StatefulWidget { ... }
class _HomeScreenState extends State<HomeScreen> { ... }

// ✅ Private classes (file scope)
class _RingPainter extends CustomPainter { ... }
class _MealItemState { ... } // Nếu dùng ChangeNotifier
```

---

## 3. Feature Folder Structure

```
features/
└── meal_plan/
    ├── models/           # Data models
    │   ├── meal_plan_model.dart
    │   └── meal_plan_requests.dart
    ├── providers/       # State management
    │   └── meal_plan_provider.dart
    ├── repositories/    # Data layer
    │   └── meal_plan_repository.dart
    ├── views/           # Screens
    │   ├── meal_plan_screen.dart
    │   └── create_meal_plan_screen.dart
    └── widgets/         # Reusable widgets
        ├── meal_item_tile.dart
        └── calorie_progress_ring.dart
```

---

## 4. Widget Components Pattern

```dart
// ✅ Screen = Scaffold + AppBar + Body
class MealPlanScreen extends StatelessWidget {
  const MealPlanScreen({super.key});

  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) {
    return Scaffold(
      appBar: AppBar(title: const Text('Kế hoạch ăn uống')),
      body: const _MealPlanBody(),
    );
  }
}

// ✅ Private body widget để tách logic
class _MealPlanBody extends StatelessWidget {
  const _MealPlanBody();

  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) {
    return Consumer<MealPlanProvider>(
      builder: (context, provider, _) {
        if (provider.isLoading) {
          return const Center(child: CircularProgressIndicator());
        }
        return ListView.builder(...);
      },
    );
  }
}
```

---

## 5. Import Order

```dart
// ✅ ĐÚNG - Theo thứ tự
import 'dart:async';           // 1. Dart core
import 'package:flutter/material.dart'; // 2. Flutter
import 'package:provider/provider.dart'; // 3. External packages
import '../models/meal_plan_model.dart'; // 4. Relative imports (nội bộ feature)
import '../../core/theme/app_colors.dart'; // 5. Core utilities
```

---

## 6. Export barrels cho feature

```dart
// features/meal_plan/meal_plan.dart
export 'models/meal_plan_model.dart';
export 'models/meal_plan_requests.dart';
export 'providers/meal_plan_provider.dart';
export 'repositories/meal_plan_repository.dart';
```

