## Quick Checklist

- [ ] File name: `snake_case.dart`
- [ ] Widget name: `PascalCase`
- [ ] Import order đúng
- [ ] Có Error/Loading/Empty states
- [ ] Dùng theme colors thay vì hardcode
- [ ] Animation dùng `SingleTickerProviderStateMixin`
